  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.79 - AM020 expression-bodied Profile constructor fixer parity\n- Expression-bodied Profile constructors expand into blocks before the missing nested map is appended\n- The original root CreateMap remains first, preserving configuration order\n- Computed, property, conditional, and indexed receivers remain fixless; expression-bodied methods are unchanged",
